---
<section id="content" class="bg-white py-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto space-y-12">

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-[36px] leading-[50.4px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          Law Firm TV & Video Commercials That Actually Work
        </h2>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
          Get your name out there. Build trust. Bring in more calls.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">
          Why TV & Video Still Win for Lawyers
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          People remember faces and voices, not just names on a billboard. A good commercial makes your firm feel familiar and trustworthy — so when someone needs help after an accident or crisis, they call you first.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>TV is still powerful</strong> — but now it's paired with streaming and digital spots.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Video builds credibility</strong> — clients see you, hear you, and start trusting you.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Great ads drive cases</strong> — plain and simple.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">
          What We Handle (So You Don't Have To)
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          We do everything in-house. That means less hassle for you and a smoother process start to finish.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>Writing the script (in your voice, not "cookie-cutter lawyer talk")</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>Casting and filming (real people, real stories, or actors if you prefer)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>Editing and polish (graphics, voiceover, music — the works)</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span>Media placement (TV, streaming, YouTube, social — wherever your clients watch)</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mt-6">
          You show up on set (if you want to), we handle the rest.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">
          Why Firms Like Yours Choose Us
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>One Stop Shop:</strong> No bouncing between agencies, producers, and buyers.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Built for Lawyers:</strong> We know the rules, the disclaimers, and what actually drives calls and cases.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Local & Regional Reach:</strong> From your city to national campaigns we have you covered.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Real Results:</strong> Calls, leads, and cases — not just "views."</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="text-[rgb(58,166,196)] font-bold mt-1">›</span>
            <span><strong>Our Team:</strong> Analyzes data weekly so we can adjust the right content at the right time to maximize effectiveness</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">
          How It Works
        </h3>
        <ol class="space-y-4 text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] list-decimal pl-6">
          <li><strong>Quick Call:</strong> We learn about your firm and what your specific goals are.</li>
          <li><strong>Creative Plan:</strong> We create the script and storyboards you can approve or tweak.</li>
          <li><strong>Production Day:</strong> Lights, cameras, action — we make it simple at our location or yours.</li>
          <li><strong>Editing:</strong> We cut, polish, and deliver a ready-to-air spot.</li>
          <li><strong>Media Placement:</strong> Get your ad where your clients are on TV, streaming, or both.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-[rgba(201,210,217,0.45)] p-8 rounded-[4px]">
        <h4 class="text-[20px] leading-[28px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">
          Don't Just Take Our Word for It
        </h4>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] italic">
          "Our phones started ringing right after the commercials went live. Professional team, easy to work with, and they know how to market a law firm." – <em>Managing Partner, PI Firm</em>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="text-[24px] leading-[33.6px] font-bold font-serif text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-4">
          Ready to Talk?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[18px] leading-[28.8px] font-normal font-sans text-[rgb(34,34,34)] mb-6">
          Let's make sure your firm is the first one people think of when they need a lawyer.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" class="bg-[rgb(34,66,125)] text-white rounded-[4px] px-6 py-3 text-[18px] font-normal hover:bg-[rgb(26,51,97)] transition-colors inline-flex items-center justify-center">
          Schedule a Consultation
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
